titioned based on user id so  we get the ability to auto scale this  service  up and down and that's that's great for  something like this where the amount of  transactions that are coming in is going  to fluctuate  throughout the day with probably more  transactions happening  in the morning and evening i would guess  and less at night  and so so great we can scale our service  automatically  based on that there's a container image  that i built  and deployed which contains my  entity code okay so that's the quick  example  of cloud state running on the light been  cloud state  service so that was cloud state for  kotlin  and that's it that we wanted to show you  today uh thanks for watching  and we hope that you will build kotlin  stuff for google cloud and check out  some resources for that  you can go to cloud.google.com kotlin  and thanks so much david for joining us  and showing us why we should use kotlin  yeah thanks james we're really excited  to see what you build with kotlin  and hope you enjoy the rest of next on  air
 

